# Server

Do not start, restart, or stop the app server. The user always runs it themselves (`go run ./cmd/server`, usually http://localhost:8080).

For a browser check, use the server they already have running. If none is up, ask them to start it. Do not launch `go run`, `nix develop`, a static file server, or any other substitute.
